	(text "Sensor jack supply select (JP2-JP10). Each jack has its own VCC net. 1x3 2.54 mm header + shunt:\npins 1-2 = 3.3 V, pins 2-3 = 5 V, no shunt = jack unpowered. JP1 (AUX1) works the same way.\nMux jacks: the pullups follow the jack's VCC, and the TCA9548A translates 3.3 V <-> 5 V per channel.\nJ18 (bus 2, straight to the MCU): only VCC changes, the bus pullups R32/R33 stay on 3.3 V.\nF3 fuses the 5 V sensor branch the same way F2 fuses SENS_3V3. AUX1 (JP1) also takes 5 V from SENS_5V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 236.22 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a3583b65-2535-4332-a403-a852ff70b593"))
